# Netlify redirects. Everything Diablo IV moved under /d4/ when the site became
# a multi game hub. These URLs are in a live sitemap that Google has already
# crawled and the domain is under manual AdSense review, so every old path 301s
# to its new home rather than 404ing. Do not delete these when the queue is
# rebuilt.
#
# Netlify's own Pretty URLs post processing stays off (netlify.toml), so the
# .html form is the one and only URL for every page and these rules do not fight
# it. Rules are matched in file order and the first match wins.

/guides.html                      /d4/guides.html                       301!
/season-14-death-awakening.html   /d4/season-14-death-awakening.html    301!
/war-plans.html                   /d4/war-plans.html                    301!
/escalations.html                 /d4/escalations.html                  301!
/helltides.html                   /d4/helltides.html                    301!

# Convenience only, never linked or canonical: /d4 without the trailing slash,
# and the extensionless forms a reader may type or another site may have linked.
/d4                               /d4/                                  301!
/d4/guides                        /d4/guides.html                       301!
/d4/season-14-death-awakening     /d4/season-14-death-awakening.html    301!
/d4/war-plans                     /d4/war-plans.html                    301!
/d4/escalations                   /d4/escalations.html                  301!
/d4/helltides                     /d4/helltides.html                    301!
/d4/ledger                        /d4/ledger.html                       301!
